{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16115","headline":"送唐大夫罢节归山 · 王建","name":"送唐大夫罢节归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年少平戎老学仙，表求骸骨乞生全。\n不堪腰下悬金印，已向云西寄玉田。\n旄节抱归官路上，公卿送到国门前。\n人间鸡犬同时去，遥听笙歌隔水烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}